<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_full_img"> 
<div id="image_02" class="mktoImg" mktolockimgsize="true">
<a href="https://www.flywire.com/news/flywires-new-international-payment-plan-options-help-improve-tuition-affordability-during-covid-19?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;"><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/header-international-payment-plans_2x.jpg" width="640" height="200" alt="header-international-payment-plans_2x.jpg" style="display:block; max-width:640px;" border="0" /></a>
