<tr class="mktoModule" id="Body_copy"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#ffffff"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding:40px 42px 0px 42px;" class="em_ptrl1"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p class="p1" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;">Introducing New International Payment Plan Options!</span></strong></p> 
<p class="p1" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 18px;"></span></strong><br /></p> 
<p class="p1" style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><i>Benefit from Flywire's flexible payment plan options and powerful global payment network.</i></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; color: #147bd1; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Education payments are expensive and can be difficult for many students and families to afford. More than ever in light of COVID-19, international students and families need flexible payment options that help make education costs more manageable.</span></p> 
<p style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">That’s why Flywire is thrilled to expand our Payment Plan offering to now support international payment methods for students and institutions <strong>worldwide</strong>!</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"></span><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Why offer Flywire’s payment plans to your international students?</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; 
text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">50% increase in plan enrollment</span></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; 
text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">24x7 self-service account access</span></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; 
text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">40% reduction in call volume</span></li> 
</ul> 
<p style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">One of our clients really said it best: </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; 
color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br /></span><em><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: 
pre-wrap;">“If you don’t have an agile payment plan solution, you are going to struggle.”</span></em></p> 
<p style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">To learn more, we’ve put together the following resources:</span></p> 
<ul style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;"> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><b><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Press Release<span>: </span></span></b><span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #48b985;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/news/flywires-new-international-payment-plan-options-help-improve-tuition-affordability-during-covid-19?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" id="" style="color: #48b985; text-decoration: underline;">Flywire Offers New International Payment Plan Options</a></span></span></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><b><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Learn More: </span></b><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/payment-plans?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: 
underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Payment Plans</span></a></li> 
<li style="list-style-type: disc; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;"><b><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Blog: </span></b><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/how-one-bursar-managed-a-crisis-and-kept-students-enrolled?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" target="_blank"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: 
underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Learn </span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">How One Bursar Managed a Crisis and Kept Students Enrolled</span></a></li> 
</ul> 
<p style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If you’re ready to future-proof your payments process, </span><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/payments?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email" style="text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #13ac52; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; 
vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">request a demo here</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> and we will be in touch!</span></p> 
<p style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;"><br /></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Best,&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Chivo,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The Flywire Team</span></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr>
